---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-nx-border bg-nx-surface px-6 py-16">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl">
    <div class="grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-4">
      <div class="md:col-span-2">
        <a href="/NX-Studio/" class="flex items-center gap-2 font-display text-xl font-bold">
          <span class="grid h-10 w-10 place-items-center rounded-md bg-gradient-to-br from-nx-accent to-nx-purple font-mono text-sm text-white">NX</span>
          <span>NX-Studio</span>
        </a>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-md text-sm text-nx-muted">
          Estudio de software LATAM. Producto + servicio. Bots de trading, ERP multi-tenant,
          auditoría electoral, experiencias 3D y más. Neiva, Colombia · Servicio remoto global.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-6 font-mono text-xs text-nx-dim">
          Sebastian Velasco Ocampo · Full-stack + IA
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-nx-accent">Sitio</h4>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm">
          <li><a href="/NX-Studio/productos" class="text-nx-muted hover:text-nx-text">Catálogo de productos</a></li>
          <li><a href="/NX-Studio/laboratorio" class="text-nx-muted hover:text-nx-text">Laboratorio IA</a></li>
          <li><a href="/NX-Studio/proceso" class="text-nx-muted hover:text-nx-text">Cómo trabajamos</a></li>
          <li><a href="/NX-Studio/precios" class="text-nx-muted hover:text-nx-text">Precios</a></li>
          <li><a href="/NX-Studio/contacto" class="text-nx-muted hover:text-nx-text">Contacto</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-nx-accent">Repos</h4>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm">
          <li><a href="https://github.com/Nxxo31" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-nx-muted hover:text-nx-text">GitHub · Nxxo31</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://github.com/Nxxo31/synthetic-trader" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-nx-muted hover:text-nx-text">Synthetic Trader</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://github.com/Nxxo31/nexocore" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-nx-muted hover:text-nx-text">NexoCore</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://github.com/Nxxo31/nva-demons" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-nx-muted hover:text-nx-text">Tatacoa NVA</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 flex flex-col gap-4 border-t border-nx-border pt-8 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs text-nx-dim">© {year} NX-Studio · Neiva, COL · UTC-05</p>
      <p class="font-mono text-xs text-nx-dim">Built with Astro + Tailwind + ⚡ Hermes</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>